  "title": {
    "zhHans": "改变命运",
    "en": "Change Your Fate"
  },
  "timeline": null,
  "storyBlocks": [
    {
      "id": "lake-fate-scene",
      "type": "scene",
      "title": {
        "zhHans": "改变命运",
        "en": "Change Your Fate"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "zhHans": "来自 《逃离方块：四季》 的记忆",
        "en": "A memory carried from Seasons"
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "structural-label",
        "sourceIds": [
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-fate-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "木屋中存在一处明确要求玩家“记得 《逃离方块：四季》”的机关。它不是彩蛋式提及，而是把 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "game",
              "id": "seasons"
            },
            "label": "逃离方块：四季"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 中获得的知识直接变成 《逃离方块：锈湖湖畔》 的可用条件。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "One mechanism in the cabin explicitly asks the player to remember "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "game",
              "id": "seasons"
            },
            "label": "Cube Escape: Seasons"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". This is more than a cameo: knowledge learned in the earlier game becomes an actionable condition inside The Lake."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "cross-game",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-fate-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "用来自 《逃离方块：四季》 的信息打开这条分支后，玩家得到不同的宝石，并用它替换默认路线中的关键位置。相同的空间和物件因此导向了不同结果。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Using information carried from Seasons opens a branch that provides a different gem, replacing the key element used in the default route. The same room and objects can therefore lead to a different result."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "cross-game",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-fate-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "这一次，逼近的 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "corrupted-soul"
            },
            "label": "腐化灵魂"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 被挡住并最终消失，随后留下一个 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "黑色方块"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "。《逃离方块：锈湖湖畔》 的“改变命运”由此获得了具体结果。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "This time the approaching "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "corrupted-soul"
            },
            "label": "Corrupted Soul"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " is held back and eventually disappears, leaving behind a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "black cube"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". The Lake's promise of changing fate becomes a concrete outcome."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-fate-p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "对档案馆而言，这是第一条被完整验证的跨作品关系：作品顺序不只是菜单排序，前作的信息可以改变后作中实际发生的事情。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "For the archive, this is the first fully demonstrated cross-game relation: play order is not merely menu ordering—information from one game can alter what actually happens in another."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "cross-game",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-fate-open-cube",
      "type": "interaction",
      "action": "open-entity",
      "target": {
        "type": "concept",
        "id": "black-cube"
      },
      "label": {
        "zhHans": "打开「黑色方块」档案",
        "en": "Open the Black Cube file"
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "original-note",
        "sourceIds": [
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-fate-note",
      "type": "note",
      "title": {
        "zhHans": "跨作品档案",
        "en": "Cross-game Archive"
      },
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "从 《逃离方块：四季》 阅读黑色方块档案时，这段 《逃离方块：锈湖湖畔》 结局信息会被进度系统遮蔽；完成 《逃离方块：锈湖湖畔》 后才自动解锁。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "When the Black Cube file is opened from Seasons, this The Lake ending detail stays redacted until The Lake is marked complete."
          }
        ]
      },
      "tone": "archive",
